OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mainly dry
OL,6,Fand bright evening with some sunny
OL,7,Fspells. Cloud and outbreaks of rain
OL,8,Fthen spreading in from the west during
OL,9,Fthe early hours.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FMainly cloudy with rain in the
OL,12,Fmorning, turning more showery in the
OL,13,Fafternoon with some brighter spells
OL,14,Fdeveloping.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA
OL,17,Fchangeable period with occasional rain
OL,18,For showers. Rain likely heavy at
OL,19,Ftimes, but becoming generally drier
OL,20,Fand brighter on Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
